      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_2155",
      "reading_order": 2768,
      "section": "/page/538/SectionHeader/12",
      "content": "Never remove and then install a replacement DCC and formatter at the same time. Doing so will cause the printer to become unstable. If a replacement DCC and formatter must be installed, first remove and install the formatter. Test operate the printer, and then if necessary install a replacement DCC. Some figure might show assemblies removed or installed that have not yet been removed at that specific step. However, the procedures are correct for this printer and the target assembly. Always thoroughly read the instructions that accompany each figure."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_2156",
      "reading_order": 2769,
      "section": "/page/538/SectionHeader/12",
      "content": "To view a short video of this procedure, click the link below."
    },
